// Battle maps (bt-6, design 3.2) — keyed by a stable, APPEND-ONLY id. Tiles are
// row-major (y outer, x inner); spawn slots are ordered. Six PvE maps (7x7 for
// one wild, 8x8 for packs of two or three: open field, water channel, rough
// choke) feed the zone pools in tactics_zones/; the two PvP maps are 8x8 and
// point-symmetric (tile (x, y) mirrors tile (7-x, 7-y), spawn_b mirrors spawn_a).
